2","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0084.03","meeting":2,"doc":"annex","pdf":84,"printed":74,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"… . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 5. Danemark. = Projet 1907. (art. 14). 6. Norvège. = Projet 1907. (art. 14) 7. Pays-Bas. = Projet 1907. (art. 24) 8. Suède. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 9. Suisse. = Projet 1907. (art. 16) 10. Italie. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . …"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","weight":1.0,"end":228,"label":"Art. 24","lang":"full","start":221}]},{"seg_id":"s0085.03","meeting":2,"doc":"annex","pdf":85,"printed":75,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"…. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 5. Denmark. Same as 1907 draft. (art. 14) 6. Norway. Same as 1907 draft. (art. 14) 7. Netherlands. Same as 1907 draft. (art. 24) 8. Sweden. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 9. Switzerland. Same as 1907 draft. (art. 16) 10. Italy. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . …"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","weight":1.0,"end":228,"label":"Art. 24","lang":"full","start":221}]}]},{"meeting":15,"section":"15","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0357.14","meeting":15,"doc":"annex","pdf":357,"printed":347,"texts":{"fr":"Nouveau; cf. Art. 23, Projet de Convention 1907; Art. 7, Projet de La Haye, Annexe 2, 1910 (Une Cour de Justice Internationale, p. 142); Art. 24, Convention Cour des Prises 1907.","en":"New; cf. Art. 23, Draft Convention, 1907; Art. 7, Hague Project, Annex 2, 1910 (Une Cour de Justice Internationale, p. 142); Art. 24, Prize Court Convention, 1907.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","weight":1.0,"end":144,"label":"Art. 24","lang":"fr","start":137},{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","weight":1.0,"end":132,"label":"Art. 24","lang":"en","start":125}]}]},{"meeting":22,"section":"22","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0505.06","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":505,"printed":495,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT, ouvrant la discussion sur l'article 24 du projet Root—Phillimore, soulève la question de savoir s'il ne faut pas indiquer que la Cour aura la faculté de siéger ailleurs. Il attire l'attention sur la formule insérée dans l'article 13 de son avant-projet.","en":"The PRESIDENT, in laying Article 24 of the Root—Phillimore plan before the Committee, raised the question as to whether a provision should not be included giving the Court the right to sit elsewhere. He drew attention to the clause contained in Article 13 of his plan.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0505.06","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","weight":1.0,"end":78,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":3939,"start":40}]},{"seg_id":"s0505.11","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":505,"printed":495,"texts":{"fr":"Mr. ROOT s'oppose formellement à donner aux Parties et à la Cour le droit de transférer le siège de la Cour dans un cas déterminé. Ce qui fait la différence entre la Cour permanente de Justice et la Cour d'Arbitrage, c'est précisément que les membres, et avant tout le Président, de la première se…","en":"Mr. ROOT was definitely opposed to giving the parties and the Court the right to transfer the seat of the Court for a particular case. The essential difference between the Permanent Court of Justice and the Court of Arbitration lay in the fact that the members, and in particular the President, of…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0505.11","speaker_id":"root","certain":true,"name":"Elihu Root","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.02","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT relève la différence entre le transfert du siège de la Cour et certains déplacements momentanés qui peuvent être nécessaires. Il fait également observer qu'aux termes de l'article 7 du Pacte de la Société des Nations, celle-ci peut transférer son siège.","en":"The PRESIDENT drew a distinction between the transfer of the seat of the Court and temporary removals which might be necessary. He also pointed out that, according to the terms of Article 7 of the Covenant of the League of Nations, the League could transfer its seat.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0506.02","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.03","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"M. DE LAPRADELLE fait valoir que cet argument parle en faveur de l'adoption de la formule simple qui se trouve à l'article 24 du projet Root—Phillimore.","en":"M. DE LAPRADELLE pointed out that this argument was in favour of the adoption of the simple wording contained in Article 24 of the Root—Phillimore plan.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0506.03","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition","Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","weight":1.0,"end":151,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":3948,"start":111},{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.04","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT met aux voix cette formule. Elle est adoptée.","en":"The PRESIDENT put this wording to the vote. It was adopted.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0506.04","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.05","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"La séance est levée à 12.40 heures de l'après-midi.","en":"The meeting closed at 12.40 p.m.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.06","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"Le Président :","en":"The President :","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.07","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"(signé) Brn. DESCAMPS.","en":"(signed) Brn. DESCAMPS","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.08","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printed":496,"texts":{"fr":"Le Secrétaire-Général :","en":"The Secretary-General :","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.root-phillimore-plan-article-24","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[506]}]},{"seg_id":"s0506.09","meeting":22,"doc":"minutes","pdf":506,"printe